              "text": "You are constructing a triangle with side lengths 18 cm and 22 cm.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What length do you need to make the third side so that the triangle is right-angled?",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Note: there are two possible answers. Round your answers to 2 decimal places.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
